---
layout: base.njk
title: Claude plays Minesweeper
description: An LLM plays Minesweeper, one board state at a time.
permalink: /minesweeper/index.html
extraStyles:
  - /css/landing-page.css
---
<section class="py-5">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="mb-2">Claude plays Minesweeper</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Play it yourself (click to reveal, right-click or Flag mode to flag) or let Claude try. Claude sees the board as text and picks several moves per turn. The page enforces the rules, so it can't cheat and has to reason its way out.</p>

    <div class="ms-settings mb-3" aria-label="Game settings">
      <label>Level
        <select id="ms-level" class="form-control form-control-sm">
          <option value="beginner">Beginner (8×8, 10 mines)</option>
          <option value="intermediate">Intermediate (16×16, 40 mines)</option>
          <option value="expert">Expert (30×16, 99 mines)</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>Player model
        <select id="ms-model" class="form-control form-control-sm">
          <option value="haiku">Haiku 4.5</option>
          <option value="sonnet">Sonnet 5</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>Thinking effort
        <select id="ms-effort" class="form-control form-control-sm">
          <option value="low">Low</option>
          <option value="medium">Medium</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label class="ms-check">
        <input type="checkbox" id="ms-verify"> Verifier reviews each move
      </label>
      <div id="ms-vrow" class="ms-vrow" hidden>
        <label>Verifier model
          <select id="ms-vmodel" class="form-control form-control-sm">
            <option value="haiku">Haiku 4.5</option>
            <option value="sonnet">Sonnet 5</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>Verifier effort
          <select id="ms-veffort" class="form-control form-control-sm">
            <option value="low">Low</option>
            <option value="medium">Medium</option>
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>
      <p id="ms-hint" class="small text-muted mb-0 ms-hint"></p>
      <p class="small text-muted mb-0 ms-hint">When Claude finishes a game, its outcome, settings, cost and time are counted anonymously (no personal data) for the <a href="/minesweeper/results/">live results page</a>. Games you play yourself are not counted.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ms-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="ms-boardwrap"><div id="ms-board" class="ms-board" aria-label="Minesweeper board"></div></div>
        <div id="ms-status" class="mt-2 font-weight-bold"></div>
        <button id="ms-toggle" class="btn btn-primary mt-2">Let Claude play</button>
        <button id="ms-new" class="btn btn-outline-secondary mt-2 ml-2">New game</button>
        <button id="ms-flagmode" class="btn btn-outline-secondary mt-2 ml-2" aria-pressed="false">Flag mode</button>
        <div id="ms-cost" class="small text-muted mt-2"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h5>What it's thinking</h5>
        <ul id="ms-log" class="list-unstyled small" style="max-height:420px; overflow:auto;"></ul>
        <h5 class="mt-4">Claude's notebook</h5>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-1">After each loss Claude writes itself a lesson. Lessons are saved only in this browser and shown to Claude in later games.</p>
        <ul id="ms-notes" class="small pl-3"></ul>
        <button id="ms-clearnotes" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">Clear notebook</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  window.MS_CONFIG = {
    proxyUrl: "{{ minesweeper.proxyUrl }}",
    resultVersion: "{{ minesweeper.resultVersion }}",
  };
</script>
<script src="/scripts/minesweeper-engine.js"></script>
<script src="/scripts/minesweeper-solver.js"></script>
<script src="/scripts/minesweeper-agent.js"></script>
<style>
  .ms-settings { display: grid; gap: .75rem 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); align-items: end; }
  .ms-settings label { margin: 0; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .ms-settings .ms-check { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; font-weight: 600; padding-bottom: .35rem; }
  .ms-settings .ms-vrow { display: contents; }
  .ms-settings .ms-vrow[hidden] { display: none; }
  .ms-hint { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .ms-grid { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  @media (min-width: 992px) { .ms-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr); } }
  #ms-log .err { color: #c0392b; }
  #ms-log .lesson { font-style: italic; }
  #ms-log .verify { color: #1e6fd9; }
  #ms-log .verify-warn { color: #b7791f; }
  #ms-log .verify-bad { color: #c0392b; }
  /* The board scrolls sideways inside its wrapper, so the 30-column Expert board never widens the page. */
  .ms-boardwrap { max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; }
  .ms-board { display: grid; gap: 2px; background: #555; padding: 2px; width: max-content; }
  .ms-cell { width: var(--cell); height: var(--cell); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700;
    background: #b8bfc6; user-select: none; font-size: var(--font); line-height: 1; cursor: pointer; }
  .ms-cell.open { background: #eceff1; cursor: default; }
  .ms-cell.mine { background: #e74c3c; }
  .ms-cell.hl { outline: 3px solid #f1c40f; outline-offset: -3px; }
  .ms-cell.n1 { color: #1e6fd9; } .ms-cell.n2 { color: #2e8b3d; } .ms-cell.n3 { color: #d93025; }
  .ms-cell.n4 { color: #1a237e; } .ms-cell.n5 { color: #8e1b1b; } .ms-cell.n6 { color: #00838f; }
  .ms-cell.n7 { color: #111; } .ms-cell.n8 { color: #777; }
  .ms-cell.flag { color: #d93025; }
  /* Once a game is over: a flag that was right, and a flag on a cell that never held a mine. */
  .ms-cell.right-flag { background: #d7f0db; color: #1b5e20; }
  .ms-cell.wrong-flag { background: #fdecea; color: #a01c12; text-decoration: line-through; }
</style>
